From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office-wp14 <wp14@office.invalid>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:52:30 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 25/42] numfmt: month and day names by locale, [$-xxx] name
 tags

mmm/mmmm/mmmmm/ddd/dddd use the locale's Windows NLS names. A [$-419] / [$-443] / [$-843] tag
(LCID, low 16 bits) names the months and days of its section for a non-English interface; the
digits are not affected, as in Excel. In the en-US interface the tags stay ignored.
